{"id": null, "total_replies": 4, "hidden_replies": 0, "replies": [{"id": 543, "parent": null, "created": 1698359580.987607, "modified": 1698359682.349212, "mode": 1, "text": "<p>Good story, good point about 'false realities'.</p>", "author": "Peter", "website": null, "likes": 0, "dislikes": 0, "notification": null, "hash": "ed7324482f16", "total_replies": 0, "hidden_replies": 0, "replies": []}, {"id": 546, "parent": null, "created": 1699057391.0466647, "modified": null, "mode": 1, "text": "<p>This was such a fun Villain Protagonist kind of story.<br>\n&quot;'And that the bug is being exploited.'<br>\nJake's blood flash-froze.&quot;<br>\nI especially loved these 2 lines</p>", "author": "Scott", "website": null, "likes": 0, "dislikes": 0, "notification": null, "hash": "e1cb09b30ba6", "total_replies": 0, "hidden_replies": 0, "replies": []}, {"id": 592, "parent": null, "created": 1752722279.7682512, "modified": null, "mode": 1, "text": "<p>Great writing, it's so nice to read a story I can relate to instead of a boring fantasy or conventional hero plot!</p>", "author": "Tyamp", "website": null, "likes": 1, "dislikes": 0, "notification": null, "hash": "83442466c373", "total_replies": 1, "hidden_replies": 0, "replies": [{"id": 593, "parent": 592, "created": 1754513030.2385623, "modified": null, "mode": 1, "text": "<p>\u2026right.</p>", "author": "niplav", "website": "http://niplav.site", "likes": 0, "dislikes": 0, "notification": null, "hash": "be191af4486e"}]}], "config": {"reply-to-self": true, "require-email": true, "require-author": true, "reply-notifications": false, "gravatar": false, "feed": true}}